    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "What these numbers are",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 37,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "id": 15
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Read this first",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Requests, not people.** The logs hold no IP address, cookie, query string or full User-Agent, so a visitor cannot be counted, only what the server was asked for.\n\n**A floor.** Chain Traveler works offline: once it is installed on a device it opens without the network, and an offline launch never reaches the server. Opens here are online launches only.\n\n**Opens, checks, downloads.** Each online launch is an open and a timetable check. A download is the timetable file itself (about 5 MB): a first install, or an update after the daily build.\n\n**Early numbers are noisy.** The site went live on 2026-11-01. They include the owner's own testing and scanners that send a browser User-Agent and so count as browsers.\n\nWhere visitors came from is not shown. Setup and privacy: github.com/uncovertechtalent-git/site-infra and the Privacy section of github.com/uncovertechtalent-git/chain-traveler."
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 38,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 9
      },
      "id": 16
    }
